      "termsTitle": "Terms and privacy",
      "termsText": "<p>Digitaal GemeenGoed and NL-Dit run this platform together. We use your data to give you access to the site, the forums and the projects, and to connect you with other members. Your profile is visible to signed-in members only; your e-mail address is never public.</p><p>Read the <a href=\"$(env:DG_BASIS_URL)/voorwaarden/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">terms</a> and the <a href=\"$(env:DG_BASIS_URL)/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">privacy statement</a>.</p>",
      "registerTitle": "Join Digitaal GemeenGoed"
